emertor dragon crypt~
Emertor, the Crypt Dragon~
A large, dark hued dragon rests atop Hellfire Keep's southernmost tower. 
~
   Emertor's steel-hard scales are a dark green color.  The creatures large
wings seem to be nearly black.  Emertor loyally serves the dark gods.  In that
capacity, he has made it his duty to guard Hellfire Keep from intruders.  This
great beast has made the keep's southernmost tower his home.  Atop the tower,
you can see glistening treasure.  The corpses Emertor has hung around the tower
discourage you from trying to take what he has claimed as his.    
~
