Sir Solbern~
A knight from Blackheart Keep sits behind a desk.
~
   Lord Skul desired a presence in Samsera so sent Sir Solbern to Hellfire
Keep.  Solbern serves as an ambassador of sorts.  Solbern was, in fact,
originally trained in Samsera.  Perhaps that's why Skul chose him.  If Lord
Skul has missions for the knights here, Sir Solbern will undoubtedly know of
them and be able to give you Skul's orders.    
~
