Lady Shersai~
A darkly beautiful woman stands here inscribing a sword with magical runes. 
~
   While female death knights are not unheard of, they are uncommon.  The
beautiful Shersai not only watches over the armory, but also creates her own
weapons and arms.  She is both skilled at working a forge and weaving dark
spells into blades and armor.  She often sells her lesser creations.  In
exchange for her greater works, she requires more than mere gold coins.    
~
